DESCRIPTION:Get in loser\, we’re going to Drag Brunch! ✨ Join host Jay
 jay Kings (Drag Brunch Saved My Life\, Family Feud Canada) and special gue
 st musical theatre superstar Mira Fantasy for Legally Fetch: A Legally Blo
 nde &amp\; Mean Girls Drag Brunch at Gusto 101! We&#x27\;re serving pink p
 erfection\, Broadway belting\, and enough iconic moments to make Regina Ge
 orge write your name in the Burn Book and Elle Woods represent you in cour
 t. Location: GUSTO 101 Doors: 11:30AM Show: 12:00PM - 3:00PM Show takes pl
 ace in the upstairs patio and requires stairs. TICKETS: $15 Early Bird $20
  General Admission *Make sure to grab your tickets early\, as seating is l
 imited! To ensure smooth service during the show\, this event features a $
 40 prix-fixe brunch menu for all guests attending Drag Brunch. Guests will
  choose from a selection of first and second course options\, followed by 
 dessert. Additional items may also be ordered à la carte. MENU: $40 pp Fi
 rst Course (choose one) • Insalata Verde – little gem\, bib lettuce\, 
 escarole\, pickled onions &amp\; red chillies\, parmigiano\, Italian vinai
 grette • Cavolo Nero – lacinato kale\, zante currants\, toasted pine n
 uts\, pecorino\, parmigiano\, lemon vinaigrette • Arancini – spicy pom
 odoro\, mozzarella\, basil crema Second Course (choose one) • Panuozzo 
 – prosciutto cotto\, fior di latte mozzarella\, arugula\, tomato vinaigr
 ette • Rigatoni alla Vodka – pomodoro\, vodka\, pancetta\, cream\, par
 migiano\, stracciatella\, chili • Strapazzate – free range scrambled e
 ggs\, prosciutto cotto\, bomba\, parmigiano\, sourdough Dessert (choose on
 e) • Tiramisù – mascarpone\, espresso\, brandy\, marsala • Cannoli 
 – ricotta\, mascarpone\, chocolate\, pistachio\, candied orange • Budi
 no Whether you&#x27\;re a Harvard-bound Elle Woods or a Plastic-in-trainin
 g\, grab your best pink outfit and get ready for a brunch experience that&
 #x27\;s so fetch\, it should be illegal! ‍
LOCATION:Gusto\, 101 Portland St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/rivals-legally-fetch-a-legally-blonde-mean
 -girls-drag-brunch-gusto-101
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
