BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Desire Vs Risk: Exploring Fantasies\, Stakes\, and What You Really
  Want
DTSTART:20260719T180000
DTEND:20260719T180000
UID:134001a1125e749f3c2dc5074f8bf3e2@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:Decode your kinky desires\, learn to assess risk\, and put it 
 together to discover what you&#x27\;re truly ready to explore in this onli
 ne workshop. How do we identify not only what kinks we want to try\, but a
 lso whether we can actually handle the real-world risks that might come wi
 th them? In this 3-hour online intensive\, you&#x27\;ll complete a Desire 
 Assessment to uncover what you desire and unpack where it comes from\, a R
 isk Assessment to identify what is and is not in your risk profile\, and p
 ut it all together into a Stoplight Chart so that you can clearly communic
 ate your interets\, boundaries\, and safety needs the next time you&#x27\;
 re ready to play. The intensive will be in parts with short breaks in betw
 een\, complete with an interactive exercise workbook to follow along and o
 pportunities for discussion - perfect for both new and experienced players
 . We Will Cover: Part 1: Desire Assessment The &quot\;why&quot\; and &quot
 \;what&quot\; of Desire Assessments Looking inward to understand desire Un
 packing the roots of desire through introspective and somatic frameworks A
 ddressing shame and how it relates to desire Naming and how to talk about 
 what we desire Part 2: Risk Assessment The &quot\;why&quot\; and &quot\;wh
 at&quot\; of risk and Risk Assessments\, along with political implications
  Risk attitude definitions Identifying activity risks\, risk levels\, and 
 personal non-negotiables Risk management practices and implementation Buil
 ding your risk profile Part 3: Put It All Together Putting your Desire and
  Risk Assessments together into a Stoplight Chart of kinks for future play
  negotiation and communication Want to save on the full Intentional Kink s
 eries? Get the Total Desire Pass! This also includes a FREE month of the n
 ew Wolfe Academy of Desire Patreon + 15% off a one-on-one coaching session
 . About the Instructor Wiley Wolfe (they/them) is a kink educator\, coach\
 , and community organizer based in Toronto\, Canada with 9+ years experien
 ce\, and they are the founder of the Wolfe Academy of Desire online educat
 ional initiative and community. Their workshops have been sought after acr
 oss the U.S. and Canada\, including at Dark Odyssey\, Kinkfest\, and Westc
 oast Bound\, with their online classes reaching kinksters worldwide. They 
 coach kinksters and couples to help them reach their goals\, have worked a
 s a Professional Dominant with hundreds of clients\, have organized 70+ co
 mmunity events\, led support groups\, created erotic immersive theatre pro
 ductions\, and more. They are currently pursuing a master’s-equivalent c
 ertification in sex coaching\, and their personal relationships all center
  power exchange\, queerness\, polyamory\, and risk-informed consent. Kink 
 is their authenticity practice. They delight in guiding both new and exper
 ienced players on their journeys\, with a particular focus on self-explora
 tion\, deepening intention\, and personal growth. Access: This class is of
 fered live and online through Zoom. You may need to download the free\, ba
 sic version of the Zoom app to join. The class will be recorded with the r
 ecording available to ticketholders for 7 days. After that time\, the reco
 rding will be available on Patreon for all tiers that have access to the a
 rchive. Recordings will not include any open group shares at the end of se
 ctions or end of class. The digital workbook accompanying this class will 
 be downloadable during class for ticketholders to keep. It can be viewed o
 n mobile or computer\, but may be easiest to interact with on computer. Zo
 om now provides closed captioning which will be available for this event. 
 ‍
LOCATION:Online\, online
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/desire-vs-risk-exploring-fantasies-stakes-
 and-what-you-really-want
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
