 lebration of our community. This is a 19+ event. A valid physical governme
 nt-issued ID is required for entry. Photography and video will be captured
  throughout the night. By attending\, you acknowledge that media may be ta
 ken during the event. If you would prefer not to appear in photos or video
 s\, please let a member of our team know and we&#x27\;ll do our best to ac
 commodate you. ‍
