  be unPHOgettable!! 🍸 Free cocktail with each ticket. Discover the tast
 e of Vietnam with the unique and delicious Vietnamese fusion style menu at
  Dzô (www.dzovieteatery.com/menu) Seating begins 12pm\, Show starts 12:3
 0pm 💅 Featuring Drag Performances by Lexi Luhst MS.G Orlandra Bloom Hos
 ted by Yuen Young 📀 Music by DJ Sumation Guest Performance by SEHO Each
  $35 ticket includes a free cocktail (regularly $17). Click on &quot\;Buy 
