DESCRIPTION:Thank Goodness It&#x27\;s Sunday :) $5 OFF Entry with a wristb
 and from day parties. FREE Entry with Camp Wiggly Wristbands Put on your S
 unday best\, sip your tips\, or ride that bender. Join us for a late check
 -out and reset your week at Wiggle Room at the Industry Weekly Social. #Wi
