BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Date with Destiny
DTSTART:20260726T200000
DTEND:20260726T200000
UID:1e874472299e3103af512f20a8827dd7@yohomo.ca
DESCRIPTION:/lineup Destiny (CA) DJ Trustfall dj miss A date with destiny\
 , a dance with time\, the road diverges\, your life flashes by\, friends a
 nd lovers visit\, on holy wings\, your foot-forward flings\, your minion k
 ings\, bashful wolf begs forgiveness\, she-kachu purrs\, under the eye of 
 a pink moon\, buff kirby stirs\, his hand on your shoulder\, his eyes brig
 ht and kind\, he smiles and tells you\, all will be fine\, take a deep bre
 ath\, why not a tryst with fate\, perhaps the jama\, July 26th\, after eig
 ht? ꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜ Making the intelligen
 t unintelligible\, reducing acts of musical alchemy to animal instinct &am
 p\; contorting the familiar into something unrecognizable are Destiny’s 
 raisons d’etre. Grown in the 80\,000+ strong vinyl archive of Etobicoke
 ’s Association of Professional Record Players (her late grandfather’s 
 DJ organization)\, she was born a legacy DJ\, but her sound is nothing if 
 not iconoclastic. Finding throughlines in all the wrong places\, she remin
 ds us that any music worth its salt is good for dancing. Trustfall is a To
 ronto-based artist\, radio host and organizer. They have a soft spot for e
 clectic\, left-handed selections and oddball psychedelia across all genres
 . They organize a bi-monthly party series called Freakers Corner at Bampot
  House in Toronto with their collective Freakers Union. miss is for cutie 
 grooves that twist and twirl you. She co-throws zoomies\, a queer party de
 dicated to sexy/fun/playful high-energy music\, and runs seesaw\, a mix se
 ries for local artists. She has opened for DJ Voices\, x3butterfly\, Archa
 ngel\, and Shai FM. ꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜꩜ Date:
  Sunday\, July 26 | 8pm - end Location: 961 College St. *Venue has two sta
 ircases\; some accessibility arrangements can be made\, but washrooms are 
 downstairs. RA tickets: $10 early birds Door tickets: $15 Poster by @suzyc
 reemcheese ‍
LOCATION:The Jama\, 961 College St
URL:https://www.yohomo.ca/event/date-with-destiny
X-SOURCE:YOHOMO
END:VEVENT
