 lebrates YOU! This time\, we also have the beautiful treat of drag perform
 ances by the one and only dianasauss! Details: 🎨 What: PYOB - an art cl
 ass where you Paint Your Own Booty (with a paint-by-numbers sketch) 💃 W
 here: Drom Taberna (458 Queen St W\, Toronto) ⏰ When: Aug 1 | 1-5 PM 
 👩‍🎨 Who: hosted &amp\; instructed by @emmytran\, featuring drag by
  dianasauss If you’re unfamiliar with the class\, it is a beginner-frien
 dly paint night where you can become your own MUSE and paint your body. In
  this collaborative art project\, you send in a reference photo\, Emmy man
 ually sketches it on a canvas with numbered sections\, and you choose your
  own colour pallete and paint. Think “Paint By Numbers\,” but customiz
 ed to YOUR BODY! All painting supplies are included. It is the most empowe
 ring and judgment-free art experience. You get to go home with a better un
 derstanding of highlights/shadows and colour theory\, AND a beautiful pain
 ting that captures YOU and your MAGIC✨🪄. Our capacity is 30 for this 
 class. 👉🎟 To buy tickets or get more info on class schedules\, visit
  the link in bio\, or go to www.paintyourownbooty.com *19+ event* ‍
